{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4eea949a-067a-8034-97e5-0367320c8f7c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T11:25:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Neusa Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I was on hold a few minutes, and I have to say, the hold music was surprisingly pleasant. But I am calling because the plow knocked over my mailbox."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me get some details. Where is the mailbox?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:22:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 384 Annandale Road, in the North End. I rent there. The mailbox was on a post at the curb and now it is lying in the snow, post and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 384 Annandale Road. And when did this happen, was it overnight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this morning, early. We only got a dusting of snow, so honestly I do not understand why a plow was even needed. But it is so cold this week that everything is hard like a rock, so maybe the post just broke."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, with this cold snap the ground is frozen solid, and a post can snap pretty easily. Did you see the plow hit it, or did you just find it down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I found it. My neighbor said he heard the truck at five. The mailbox is cracked on the side, and the door is not closing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the post is down and the box is cracked. I'll write that up as a plow damage report for 384 Annandale Road, and someone from the department will look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And one more thing. The road is icy where the plow went. Can you send sand? Is that the right word, sand? For the ice, so people do not slip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sand is right. Sand or a sand and salt mix. I'll add a request for sanding on Annandale Road. Do you mean right in front of your building, or the whole block?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly in front of my building, and the corner. It is very slippery there. The mail carrier will fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. In front of the building and at the corner. Let me read it back. Mailbox and post knocked down by a plow this morning at 384 Annandale Road, and a request for sand at that spot and the corner. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Will somebody call me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They may. Can I have a number, just in case?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0181. Perfect. Anything else, Ms. Gomes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. I just hope somebody comes today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll get this passed along right away. You take care, and stay warm."
    }
  ],
